# An X session on Dolly's display: the Xsdl server, twm managing the
# windows, and three of X's own clients in theirs: a clock, eyes that follow
# the pointer and a terminal with a shell, where imgui-x11 starts Dear ImGui's
# example in a window of its own.
FROM /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-system e0034ab22529f54ef2e90908e56162da4fa2355974802302091210c762748740
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server 0f3bb43f1e40b4b4b631e8e07433cc5d2f83b671ecade23c2fc51be44590aa0f
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-twm ccf1b4760e442d414e1bce8067d1099706c0dd183c6e6849ba14ace5515af335
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xclock 422c60162d3799438f4fa2071f1957b0b6d7b8224cae0064a87569e377f7999e
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xeyes 517cef3dc3834562bf0135c78f0a205f4d805853f5f826c336ad752354150f08
